>MbhC
na vidyate yadā māṃsaṃ kapotena samaṃ dhṛtam | tata utkṛttamāṃso 'sāv āruroha svayaṃ tulām || 27
>MbhS
na vidyate yadā māṃsaṃ kapotena samaṃ dhṛtam | tataḥ prakṣīṇamāṃso 'sāv āruroha tulāṃ svayam || 28 ||
>VpŚ2
na vidyate yadā māṃsaṃ kapotena samaṃ kvacit | tataḥ prakṣīṇamāṃso 'pi sādhuḥ sukhayate param || yadā tena na tulyaṃ tat_ sa tulām āruhat_ svayam |
>VpŚ
na vidyate yadā māṃsaṃ kapotena samaṃ kvacit | tataḥ prakṣīṇamāṃso pi sādhuḥ sukhayate paraṃ || yadā tena na tulyaṃ tat sa tulām āruhat__ svayaṃ |
